// n95compat: kernel-side stand-ins for Nokia N95 hardware drivers, used by the option 1 hybrid
// ROM (docs/roadmap.md). Built against the Syborg variant (copied under
// sf/adapt/qemu/baseport/syborg/n95compat by scripts/build-n95compat.sh).
